Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.63-rt92 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.63 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: ffdb796515ceb4c3fa5f6bc43a61fce3e0066d1e


Or to build 3.2.63-rt92 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.63.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.63-rt92.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

